# Build-time variables for the fan site (Next static export: NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined at BUILD time,
# so a change on the host needs a new deploy). Set them on the host (Netlify: Project configuration >
# Environment variables), or in Website/.env.local for a local build (git-ignored). Never commit real values.

# REQUIRED on Netlify/CI (release-gate.mjs fails the build without it). The Supabase PUBLISHABLE key
# (sb_publishable_...) for the community chat's live feed. Public by design, but kept out of source.
# Never a legacy JWT key (eyJ...) and never a secret key (sb_secret_...): both are refused.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Optional overrides (the code has the production defaults).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://wfxpxwlynsphutjhhdje.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TEOS_API=https://api-production-f6b6.up.railway.app/v1
